<blockquote>
<p>Note: Under no circumstances are personnel who have participated in any part of Procedure ███-███████ to be allowed to use SCP-1978. -O5-██</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I wonder what that could be, maybe it's 110-Montauk.</p>
<p>As for the SCP itself, I found it rather boring, reading it was more of a chore than anything else. It really dragged on and on with all the little details regarding data archives while the main effect is rather simple (&quot;A shower what washes away X&quot; in this case X is guilt/sin.)</p>

